d class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Stone\">$22.5/stud</td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Refined\">$15/stud</td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Forged\">$20/stud</td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">v1.4.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">March 10th, 2023</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Status\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Obtainable</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>Blackstone spawns everywhere in <a href=\"/wiki/Magma_Caves\" title=\"Magma Caves\">Magma Caves</a> and commonly in the eastern savannah of <a href=\"/wiki/Ferwater\" title=\"Ferwater\">Ferwater</a>. This node has a medium range of sizes and is one of the two stones that can contain <a href=\"/wiki/Obsidian\" title=\"Obsidian\">Obsidian</a>, the other being <a href=\"/wiki/Lavaslate\" title=\"Lavaslate\">Lavaslate</a>.\n</p><p>Blackstone has a black appearance, and the darkest of all nodes in-game, even more so than <a href=\"/wiki/Darkslate\" title=\"Darkslate\">darkslate</a>.\n</p>\n<h5><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"The_chart_below_displays_all_possible_ores_that_spawn_within_this_node.\">The chart below displays all possible ores that spawn within this node.</span></h5>\n<table class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed fandom-table\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Picture</th>\n<th>Name</th>\n<th>Notes\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/d8/Gold1.png/revision/latest?cb=20230124105142\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Gold1\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Gold1.png\" data-image-key=\"Gold1.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/d8/Gold1.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/128?cb=20230124105142\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure></td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Gold\" title=\"Gold\">Gold</a></td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/02/Rose_gold.png/revision/latest?cb=20230710190648\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Rose gold\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Rose gold.png\" data-image-key=\"Rose_gold.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/02/Rose_gold.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/128?cb=20230710190648\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure></td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Rose_Gold\" title=\"Rose Gold\">Rose Gold</a></td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/3/3e/Obsidianraw.png/revision/latest?cb=20230703053051\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Obsidianraw\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"128\" height=\"127\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Obsidianraw.png\" data-image-key=\"Obsidianraw.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/3/3e/Obsidianraw.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/128?cb=20230703053051\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure></td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Obsidian\" title=\"Obsidian\">Obsidian</a></td>\n<td>Unknown spawn chance<br />\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/6/6f/Palladiumraw.png/revision/latest?cb=20230703083707\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Palladiumraw\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"128\" height=\"110\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Palladiumraw.png\" data-image-key=\"Palladiumraw.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/6/6f/Palladiumraw.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/128?cb=20230703083707\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure></td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Palladium\" title=\"Palladium\">Palladium</a></td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><div id=\"gallery-1\" hash=\"5145d26db879fcb137abc71d230e4916\" data-seq-no=\"1\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div cla